      "Language": "fre",
      "Abstract": {"AbstractText": "In this trial, 20 patients suffering from bone metastasis pain received diclofenac, a non-steroid anti-inflammatory agent, by continuous IV infusion. No pain was observed in 77% after 2.7 days of treatment. 33% of bedridden patients were able to move again. Two patients (10%) presented gastric pain controlled by symptomatic treatment."},
